{"id":"ws9-mn36","title":"eseva maggo bodhāya","titleEn":"That Is the Path to Enlightenment","ref":"MN 36 · excerpt","source":"Pāḷi Workshop booklet","credit":"Pāḷi text and English translation as in Mor’s Pāḷi Workshop booklet.","section":"extra","collection":"workshop","group":"9 · nirodhasacca & maggasacca","groupSub":"The Path and Its End","paras":[{"t":[["“…"],[" "],["na","na"],[" "],["kho","kho"],[" "],["pan’āhaṃ","pan’āhaṃ"],[" "],["imāya","imāya"],[" "],["kaṭukāya","kaṭukāya"],[" "],["dukkara-kārikāya","dukkara-kārikāya"],[" "],["adhigacchāmi","adhigacchāmi"],[" "],["uttari","uttari"],[" "],["manussa-dhammā","manussa-dhammā"],[" "],["alam-ariya-ñāṇa-dassana-visesaṃ","alam-ariya-ñāṇa-dassana-visesaṃ"],["."],[" "],["siyā","siyā"],[" "],["nu","nu"],[" "],["kho","kho"],[" "],["añño","añño"],[" "],["maggo","maggo"],[" "],["bodhāyā’ti","bodhāyā’ti"],["?"]],"en":"“… But by this racking practice of austerities I have not attained any superhuman states, any distinction in knowledge and vision worthy of the noble ones. Could there be another path to enlightenment?’","lines":true},{"t":[["tassa","tassa"],[" "],["mayhaṃ","mayhaṃ"],[","],[" "],["aggivessana","aggivessana"],[","],[" "],["etad","etad"],[" "],["ahosi","ahosi"],[":"],[" "],["‘"],["abhijānāmi","abhijānāmi"],[" "],["kho","kho"],[" "],["pan’āhaṃ","pan’āhaṃ"],[" "],["pitu","pitu"],[" "],["sakkassa","sakkassa"],[" "],["kammante","kammante"],[" "],["sītāya","sītāya"],[" "],["jambu-cchāyāya","jambu-cchāyāya"],[" "],["nisinno","nisinno"],[" "],["vivicc’eva","vivicc’eva"],[" "],["kāmehi","kāmehi"],[","],[" "],["vivicca","vivicca"],[" "],["akusalehi","akusalehi"],[" "],["dhammehi","dhammehi"],[","],[" "],["sa-vitakkaṃ","sa-vitakkaṃ"],[" "],["sa-vicāraṃ","sa-vicāraṃ"],[" "],["viveka-jaṃ","viveka-jaṃ"],[" "],["pīti-sukhaṃ","pīti-sukhaṃ"],[" "],["paṭhamaṃ","paṭhamaṃ"],[" "],["jhānaṃ","jhānaṃ"],[" "],["upasampajja","upasampajja"],[" "],["viharitā","viharitā"],["."],[" "],["siyā","siyā"],[" "],["nu","nu"],[" "],["kho","kho"],[" "],["eso","eso"],[" "],["maggo","maggo"],[" "],["bodhāyā’ti","bodhāyā’ti"],["?"]],"en":"I considered: ‘I recall that when my father the Sakyan was occupied, while I was sitting in the cool shade of a rose-apple tree, quite secluded from sensual pleasures, secluded from unwholesome states, I entered upon and abided in the first jhāna, which is accompanied by applied and sustained thought, with rapture and pleasure born of seclusion. Could that be the path to enlightenment?’","lines":true},{"t":[["tassa","tassa"],[" "],["mayhaṃ","mayhaṃ"],[","],[" "],["aggivessana","aggivessana"],[","],[" "],["sat’ānusāri","sat’ānusāri"],[" "],["viññāṇaṃ","viññāṇaṃ"],[" "],["ahosi","ahosi"],[":"],[" "],["‘"],["es’eva","es’eva"],[" "],["maggo","maggo"],[" "],["bodhāyā’ti","bodhāyā’ti"],["."]],"en":"Then, following on that memory, came the realization: ‘That is indeed the path to enlightenment.’","lines":true},{"t":[["tassa","tassa"],[" "],["mayhaṃ","mayhaṃ"],[","],[" "],["aggivessana","aggivessana"],[","],[" "],["etad","etad"],[" "],["ahosi","ahosi"],[":"],[" "],["‘"],["kiṃ","kiṃ"],[" "],["nu","nu"],[" "],["kho","kho"],[" "],["ahaṃ","ahaṃ"],[" "],["tassa","tassa"],[" "],["sukhassa","sukhassa"],[" "],["bhāyāmi","bhāyāmi"],[","],[" "],["yaṃ","yaṃ"],[" "],["taṃ","taṃ"],[" "],["sukhaṃ","sukhaṃ"],[" "],["aññatr’eva","aññatr’eva"],[" "],["kāmehi","kāmehi"],[","],[" "],["aññatra","aññatra"],[" "],["akusalehi","akusalehi"],[" "],["dhammehī’ti","dhammehī’ti"],["?"],["\n"],["tassa","tassa"],[" "],["mayhaṃ","mayhaṃ"],[","],[" "],["aggivessana","aggivessana"],[","],[" "],["etad","etad"],[" "],["ahosi","ahosi"],[":"],[" "],["‘"],["na","na"],[" "],["kho","kho"],[" "],["ahaṃ","ahaṃ"],[" "],["tassa","tassa"],[" "],["sukhassa","sukhassa"],[" "],["bhāyāmi","bhāyāmi"],[","],[" "],["yaṃ","yaṃ"],[" "],["taṃ","taṃ"],[" "],["sukhaṃ","sukhaṃ"],[" "],["aññatr’eva","aññatr’eva"],[" "],["kāmehi","kāmehi"],[","],[" "],["aññatra","aññatra"],[" "],["akusalehi","akusalehi"],[" "],["dhammehī’ti","dhammehī’ti"],